@startuml
title POST /api/v1/importRemoteSql (Success case)

actor ApiUser
participant SqlBridgeController
participant SqlBridgeService
participant UrlDownloadService
participant SqlFileStorageService

== 1. HTTP Request ==
ApiUser -> SqlBridgeController: POST /api/v1/importRemoteSql {"url":"share-file.com"}

== 2. Import remote SQL ==
SqlBridgeController -> SqlBridgeService: importFromUrl(url)
SqlBridgeService -> UrlDownloadService: fetch(url)
UrlDownloadService -> UrlDownloadService: validateUrl(url)
UrlDownloadService --> SqlBridgeService: DownloadedObject(bytes, contentType, fileName)

SqlBridgeService -> SqlFileStorageService: store(bytes, fileName, contentType)
SqlFileStorageService --> SqlBridgeService: StoredFile(path, fileName, size)

== 3. Response ==
SqlBridgeService --> SqlBridgeController: ImportResult(path, fileName, size, status)
SqlBridgeController --> ApiUser: 201 Created + ImportResponse(...)

@enduml